              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0099",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration AWS-0099\nType: Terraform Security Check\nSeverity: LOW\nCheck: Missing description for security group.\nMessage: Security group explicitly uses the default description.\nLink: [AWS-0099](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0099)\nSecurity groups should include a description for auditing purposes.\n\nSimplifies auditing, debugging, and managing security groups.\n",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration AWS-0099**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Terraform Security Check|LOW|Missing description for security group.|Security group explicitly uses the default description.|[AWS-0099](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0099)|\n\nSecurity groups should include a description for auditing purposes.\n\nSimplifies auditing, debugging, and managing security groups.\n"
              },
